    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The intent of this feature is build a PoC / MVP version of the WYSIWYG GrapeJS editor in accordance with the base mocks and integration requirements. On completion of this work and any outstanding base Template Engine work, the goal is to be able to plug in to the full campaign execution PoC workflow and see master images created end-to-end. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The core goal is to design the interface with pieces such that we can plug and play with other implementations of the PDF gen such as PDFKit/Lib. "
            }
          ]
        },
